---
// Ginny Allen - Central Dentist
import TeamMemberTemplate from '../../layouts/TeamMemberTemplate.astro';
import BlurFade from '../../components/ui/BlurFade.astro';
---

<TeamMemberTemplate
  title="Ginny Allen | Marketing and Patient Communications Specialist | Central Dentist"
  description="Meet Ginny Allen, Marketing and Patient Communications Specialist at Central Dentist. With 31+ years in dentistry, Ginny builds community relationships and makes every patient feel heard and cared for."
  memberName="Ginny Allen"
  role="Marketing and Patient Communications Specialist"
  imageUrl="/images/team/ginny-allen.jpg"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Team', href: '/team' },
    { label: 'Ginny Allen', href: '/team/ginny-allen' }
  ]}
>
  <div slot="biography" class="bio-content">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 400; color: #006786; margin-bottom: 1rem;">About Ginny</h3>
    <p>With 31+ years in dentistry, Ginny has basically seen it all (yes, even that one thing you're thinking of). She's worn more hats than a Kentucky Derby: dental assistant, treatment coordinator, insurance whisperer, office manager, and financial guru. Translation? If it happens in a dental office, Ginny already knows about it… and probably fixed it once (or ten times).</p>

    <p>Now as our Marketing and Patient Communications Specialist at Central Dentist, Ginny is the friendly voice, the connection-maker, and the reason patients actually enjoy coming to the dentist (we know, shocking). She builds community relationships, keeps communication clear (goodbye confusing dental jargon), and makes sure every patient feels heard, comfortable, and maybe even… excited?</p>

    <p>She's also walked the walk. After years of misdiagnoses herself, Ginny knows firsthand how life-changing the right care can be. That's why she's so passionate about helping patients feel confident and truly cared for.</p>
  </div>

  <div slot="specialties" class="member-section mt-8">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; color: #2d3748; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Ginny's Superpowers</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600">
      <li class="flex items-start">
        <span class="text-green-500 mr-2">•</span>
        <span>Turning strangers into lifelong patients (and friends)</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start">
        <span class="text-green-500 mr-2">•</span>
        <span>Explaining dentistry like a normal human</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start">
        <span class="text-green-500 mr-2">•</span>
        <span>Making marketing feel personal, not salesy</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start">
        <span class="text-green-500 mr-2">•</span>
        <span>Creating patient experiences people actually rave about</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start">
        <span class="text-green-500 mr-2">•</span>
        <span>Knowing what's happening clinically and behind the scenes (basically magic)</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div slot="philosophy" class="member-section bg-green-50 rounded-xl p-6 mt-8">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; color: #2d3748; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Personal Touch (yes, she leaves the office sometimes)</h3>
    <p class="text-gray-700">When she's not being amazing at Central Dentist, you'll find Ginny camping or boating on Lake Texoma, living her best outdoorsy life with family and friends. Fresh air, good people, and a little sunshine. Pretty much the same energy she brings to the office every day.</p>
  </div>

  <section slot="cta" class="py-12 md:py-16" style="background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #0099ba, #006786);">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 text-center">
      <BlurFade delay={100} client:load>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-normal text-white mb-4"
            style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">
          Experience the Central Dentist Difference
        </h2>
      </BlurFade>

      <BlurFade delay={200} client:load>
        <p class="text-lg text-white/90 mb-8" style="font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;">
          Our team is dedicated to providing exceptional care with warmth and purpose
        </p>
      </BlurFade>

      <BlurFade delay={300} client:load>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="px-8 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#a6b443] to-[#c7cd85] text-white rounded-full font-semibold transition-all duration-300 hover:from-[#8fa339] hover:to-[#a6b443] hover:shadow-lg inline-flex items-center justify-center"
            style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;"
          >
            Contact Us
          </a>
          <a
            href="tel:214-368-0900"
            class="px-8 py-3 bg-white border-2 rounded-full font-semibold transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg inline-flex items-center justify-center"
            style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; color: #0099ba; border-color: white;"
            onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#006786'; this.style.color='white'; this.style.borderColor='#006786';"
            onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='white'; this.style.color='#0099ba'; this.style.borderColor='white';"
          >
            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="mr-2 w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
            </svg>
            Call Now: (214) 368-0900
          </a>
        </div>
      </BlurFade>
    </div>
  </section>

</TeamMemberTemplate>
